OL,3,AEarly results suggest Labour ahead of
OL,4,ANational in New Zealand election with
OL,5,Avotes still being counted
OL,6,
OL,7,FSymone, 28, says she finds the major
OL,8,Fparties "a little bit bleak". She tells
OL,9,Four reporter in Wellington: "I think
OL,10,Fwe're all tired... that's one of the
OL,11,Freasons I want change"
OL,13,FNew Zealand's voting system - mixed
OL,14,Fmember proportional - means most
OL,15,Fgovernments are coalitions. Meanwhile,
OL,16,Fthe country could be on course to see
OL,17,Fits biggest parliament ever after this
OL,18,Felection
